{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50526","headline":"赠崔十娘 · 张鷟","name":"赠崔十娘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自隐多姿则，欺他独自眠。\n故故将纤手，时时弄小弦。\n耳闻犹气绝，眼见若爲怜。\n从渠痛不肯，人更别求天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张鷟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}